eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":13907525,"digest":"sha256:5dcf12aa8525eabd0c46ec414f323ab6cf65229fc2cd46543cc705001bbaf223","download_count":4007,"created_at":"2026-09-30T02:40:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T02:40:01Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.102.0/gh_2.102.0_windows_arm64.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/cli/tarball/v2.102.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/cli/zipball/v2.102.0","body":"## Security\n\nFour security vulnerabilities have been identified, and fixed, in this release. Users are advised to update gh to version `v2.102.0` as soon as possible.\n\n`gh release download`, `gh run download`, `gh repo read-file --output`, and `gh attestation download` could write remote content to an unintended local file when the destination contained symbolic links.\n\nSee https://github.com/cli/cli/security/advisories/GHSA-39wj-f2f4-978v for more information.\n\n`gh attestation verify` compared the `--source-ref` value case-insensitively, so an attestation built from a branch whose name differs only in case could satisfy a policy that named a different branch.\n\nSee https://github.com/cli/cli/security/advisories/GHSA-4mq3-hpgx-9cx8 for more information.\n\nInteractive `gh skill search` passed repository paths from search results to `gh skill install` without an option separator, so a search result could inject installer options and change where skill files were written.\n\nSee https://github.com/cli/cli/security/advisories/GHSA-qcwj-mr2r-2cx7 for more information.\n\n`gh attestation verify` matched the `--signer-workflow` value against only the start of the signing certificate's identity, so an attestation signed by a different workflow in the pinned repository could pass verification when its path began with the pinned value.\n\nSee https://github.com/cli/cli/security/advisories/GHSA-wjmr-j3rp-mh2g for more information.\n\n## What's Changed\n\n### 🐛 Fixes\n\n* Allow `ghu_` tokens for supported actors to attach files by @BagToad in [#14516](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14516)\n* Allow repo set-default --unset without an argument by @williammartin in [#14540](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14540)\n\n### 📚 Docs & Chores\n\n* Prioritize HackerOne for vulnerability reports by @BagToad in [#14497](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14497)\n* Clarify reviewer-facing PR guidance by @williammartin in [#14509](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14509)\n* Add a skill for chaptered CLI recordings by @BagToad in [#14475](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14475)\n* Improve CLI recording rendering by @williammartin in [#14507](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14507)\n* Mention gh CLI in the README intro by @BagToad in [#14517](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14517)\n* Document search operator support in `gh search` help by @waldyrious in [#14519](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14519)\n* Remove host versions from `gh project item-list` help by @BagToad in [#14553](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14553)\n\n### :dependabot: Dependencies\n\n* chore(deps): bump the codeql-actions group with 3 updates by @dependabot in [#14486](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14486)\n* chore(deps): bump nodeselector/setup-apple-codesign from 0.0.2 to 0.0.3 by @dependabot in [#14487](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14487)\n* chore(deps): bump charm.land/bubbletea/v2 from 2.0.9 to 2.0.10 by @dependabot in [#14541](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14541)\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/klauspost/compress from 1.20.0 to 1.20.1 by @dependabot in [#14542](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14542)\n* chore(deps): bump the codeql-actions group with 3 updates by @dependabot in [#14543](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14543)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/cli/cli/compare/v2.101.0...v2.102.0\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/cli/releases/399674740/reactions","total_count":32,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":6,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":10,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":4}